# What

Currently instantiation of a protobuf message can be done using a ruby-hash but does not support instantiating the nested messages using nested hashes. Being able to support the instantiation of messages including nested messages using a single hash would be a **big** usability win for [googleapis/toolkit](https://github.com/googleapis/toolkit).

