The `MapEntry` field has [pass-by-reference setters](https://github.com/google/protobuf/blob/master/php/src/Google/Protobuf/Internal/MapEntry.php#L42). Because of this, the result of `defaultValue` in `Message` being called [in the constructor](https://github.com/google/protobuf/blob/master/php/src/Google/Protobuf/Internal/Message.php#L73) needs to be set to a variable before being passed in, to avoid throwing a Strict Standards error. Something like this will work:

```php
$setter = $field->getSetter();
$defaultValue = $this->defaultValue($field);
$this->$setter($defaultValue);
```

Otherwise this error is thrown: 

```
Strict Standards: Only variables should be passed by reference
