Hello, I would like to propose supporting the repeated type in map values. With projects like grpc-gateway protobufs are increasingly being converted to JSON. Often the user touchpoint is with the JSON object itself. There are many good reasons for a map of list.
```
{
  "/myroute": [
      {
        "action": "GET",
