I am using Python 3.5 on Ubuntu 16.04. I have tried with protobuf 3.5.1 and 3.5.2. It occurs only with the C backend i.e. I see the problem with `pip install protobuf==3.5.2` but NOT with `pip install --no-binary :all: protobuf==3.5.2`.

Here is the specifics of how to reproduce. First the schema:

