After investigating it a bit, @mercret and I believe the issue stems from https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/blob/45d03a977193d1dcce5251e4bffe17bf0ba738ec/src/google/protobuf/util/internal/protostream_objectwriter.cc#L344-L345 approximately, where the options on the parent writer are not properly propagated to the child writer.  We believe the fix is relatively straight forward and would be happy to submit a PR

