I do not think I have rights to create a pull request. But making this change improves performance by about 50%, not to mention GC improvements. And I think is will benefit majority of your clients.

  public static ByteString copyFromUtf8(String text) {
    if (text.isEmpty())
      return ByteString.EMPTY;

    return new LiteralByteString(text.getBytes(Internal.UTF_8));
  }


