* Apache ignite documentation: https://apacheignite.readme.io/docs/binary-marshaller
* Hazelcast docs: https://docs.hazelcast.org/docs/3.0/manual/html/ch03.html
* EHcache docs https://www.ehcache.org/documentation/3.0/serializers-copiers.html
