While we could include a `RepeatedField::toArray()` function ourselves, I'm not convinced we should add this to the main library, since this function is so easy to write manually.

I was looking into this myself, but I found it is actually easier than @haberman suggested - you can wrap the call that returns the repeated field with iterator_to_array (https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.iterator-to-array.php). 

