3. In the output JSON string, fields with default values are serialized for the standalone variable, but not for the oneof.

Proto message:
```
message MyMessage {
    int32 value = 1;
}
message MyCompositeMessage{
    
    MyMessage standaloneVariable = 1;

    oneof oneOfVariable{
        MyMessage myMessageOneOfVariable = 2;
