https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/blob/d7a26435fb36b61d742c053407e3a61fb1012706/cmake/install.cmake#L148

For the time being I've created a patch which makes the native PHP extension compile (apply patch to release 3.14.0 from here or PECL). Seems to work but I didn't run tests, so by all means don't put this in production. If anyone who's more familiar with the profobuf codebase would like to provide a second pair of eyes, feel free. Just need this thing in staging for now. Cheers

PS: This is cherry-picked from commits to master since 3.14.0:

- https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/823f351448f7c432bed40b89ee3309e0a94c1855
- https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/7089ff0ef217e573ab89653d9905f817caeb2afb
- https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/468bc193ec155756bccf2b2d9eeb8e003d95ce31

