**Describe the problem you are trying to solve.**
Unmarshal JSON onto an existing proto message without resetting the message first.

Updating from proto2 to proto3 breaks backwards compatibility when unmarshalling json.
Using jsonpb.UnmarshalString with proto2 only set the properties available in the JSON and left all other properties untouched.
Using protojson.Unmarshal with proto3 resets the passed proto object and doesn't allow to merge anymore.
```
func (o UnmarshalOptions) unmarshal(b []byte, m proto.Message) error {
	proto.Reset(m)
```

The workaround for now is to convert from proto3 to proto2, UnmarshalString and convert back to proto3.

