I worked around this issue by setting `option optimize_for = LITE_RUNTIME;` in the .proto file per the [suggesion](https://groups.google.com/g/protobuf/c/RZRCnOywdSk/m/HsOaheyFCQAJ) but it'd remove reflection support.

Hopefully it (or other more elegant solutions) would unblock your work.

