```

**What did you expect to see**
I expected to see an error related to the fact that a map field can only include a single entry per key.

**What did you see instead?**
The compile succeeded. The resulting descriptor's binary encoding includes both values, which means any code that tries to examine it at runtime will effectively discard the earlier value and see only `"baz"`.

```protobuf
// relevant snippet of output from:
// protoc test.proto google/protobuf/descriptor.proto \
//       --decode google.protobuf.FileDescriptorSet \
//       < test.protoset
