syntax = "proto3";

import "google/protobuf/descriptor.proto";

message Foo {
  optional string oo = 1;

  extend google.protobuf.MessageOptions {
    string _oo = 1001;
  }
}
```

To avoid these confusing name collisions, the code should also examine the names of nested messages, enums, and extensions, in addition to oneofs and fields.

