Actually my theory above was slightly wrong: the compiler always has access to the visibility declaration, but it was appearing too late:
```
:In file included from /home/acozzette/src/protobuf/src/google/protobuf/repeated_field.h:61,
                 from /home/acozzette/src/protobuf/src/google/protobuf/implicit_weak_message.h:39,
