I think the fix is just to move the `PROTOBUF_EXPORT_TEMPLATE_DECLARE` declaration further up in repeated_ptr_field.h so that it appears *before* we ever instantiate `RepeatedPtrField<std::string>`. I guess GCC ignored the visibility attributes because they appeared too late, but Clang was OK with accepting them anyway.

