using Google.Protobuf.WellKnownTypes;

var fieldMask = new FieldMask
{
    Paths = { "user.display_name", "photo", "reviews.`John Smith`" }
};

Console.WriteLine(JsonFormatter.Default.Format(fieldMask));
```

Unhandled exception. System.InvalidOperationException: Invalid field mask to be converted to JSON: reviews.`John Smith`

