Yikes! I deeply apologize, never noticed that this one was assigned to me. What's happening here is that upb is attempting to convert field names to lowerCamelCase for JSON as per the spec. In this example, both field names end up mapping to 'eventType' and this causes a name collision.

You should be able to manually set the JSON name via a field option, something like the following:

message CameraEvent {
	optional fixed32 eventType = 1;
	optional fixed32 event_type = 2 [json_name="event_type"];
}

