**Issue:** 

The protobuf files generated by "protoc.exe" differ between debug "protoc.exe" and release "protoc.exe", and in the debug version they generate references to unknown WriteInt32ToArrayWithField

**When Issue first appeared:** 

22.4.0 was the first version with this issue. Older versions are working fine.

