| ---------------- | ------------------ | ------------------ | --------: | --------: | --------: | -----: | --------: |
| DefaultForeach   | .NET 7.0           | .NET 7.0           | 33.161 ns | 0.3042 ns | 0.2846 ns | 0.0032 |      40 B |
