Extensions [always have explicit presence](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/blob/main/src/google/protobuf/descriptor.cc#L3927). If an attempt is made to set the `field_presence` feature to `IMPLICIT`, the result is an error: "Extensions can't specify field presence".

Unfortunately, if the file default is set to `IMPLICIT`, `protoc` is acting as if the extension's field presence inherits this and does not allow setting a default value.
```proto
// test.proto
edition = "2023";
option features.field_presence = IMPLICIT;
message Extendee {
  extensions 1 to 2;
}
extend Extendee {
  uint32 ext_with_default = 1 [default = 123];
}
```

```
test.proto:8:10: Implicit presence fields can't specify defaults.
```

